  data: {
    LLM: 'Focus on creating valid melds quickly. Use wild tiles (jokers and 2s) to complete difficult melds. Watch which tiles your partner is collecting. Take muerto when you have a strong position to use the extra tiles.\n\nTrack which tiles have been played and discarded. Coordinate with partner on escalera vs pierna strategies. Time your go-out carefully - going out early may deny opponents their muerto bonus. Balance pure vs impure canastas.\n\nCalculate optimal discard pile takes based on visible tiles. Force opponents into difficult positions by holding key tiles. Advanced tile counting to predict opponent hands. Optimize meld layouts for maximum scoring potential.',
